Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi, come look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The members-only auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking over the list\Nof what they'll have on the blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, what'd you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the CEO\Nof Kaburagi Real Estate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is an avid art collector and putting\Na number of his pieces on auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is a painting Hitomi\Nhas been after for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't one\NI've been wanting, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that, the one next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Is that {\i1}A Girl from One Day?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting it either.\NI can't believe that it's in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rui, I absolutely have to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.09,0:00:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But it isn't one of the works\Ngoing up for auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's currently being held\Nin a storage room
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}on the top floor{\i0}\N{\i1}of Akitsushima Transportation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're known for having one of{\i0}\N{\i1}the most rigorous security systems{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in the entire country.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost impossible to break into.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.77,0:01:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do know one way to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,First, our objective is to steal these.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:33.80,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Racing through the midnight streets{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:37.68,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Jewels swaying close to my ears{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.26,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}A night bird vanishing{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:44.89,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1\}Slipped through the long nails{\i0}\N{\i1}and high-rise towers{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:51.86,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Sorry, but I've been lying to you{\i0}\N{\i1}from the very start{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:56.19,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The truth is never what meets the eye{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.78,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's always hidden in secrets{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:03.29,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm tired of boring imitations{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.75,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ephemeral blooms from liars{\i0}\N{\i1}Artificial flowers of "truth"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:10.29,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm obedient to vague temptations{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:14.96,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But in the end, I'll take it all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:16.92,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the beat of your pulse, ready?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Magic, magic, magic{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:22.93,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dance to my signal{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.14,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}One day, all of it, get it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.93,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Magic, magic, magic{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:30.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A fantasy of secrets, tricks unseen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:33.86,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Un, deux, trois, jump in, baby!{\i0}\N{\i1}Dancing all night{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:36.03,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Back and forth{\i0}\N{\i1}between illusion and reality{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:38.15,OP,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll bewilder you, it's a mystery{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:41.07,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ignite the searchlight{\i0}\N{\i1}That becomes my spotlight{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.66,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}But just staring at me{\i0}\N{\i1}Won't tell you a thing{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This is my love in labyrinth{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:55.24,Title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur6.532\fad(400,200)\\pos(468,818.505)}Memory Of Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Listen up. We're after{\i0}\N{\i1}the three gold-leaf tenmoku tea bowls{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}made by Junkei Tobari.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}They're in the vault{\i0}\N{\i1}inside Kaburagi Real Estate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I expect this should all go to plan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just keep an ear out{\i0}\N{\i1}for any other instructions.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Copy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You got it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome in.\NThe intake sheet is just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. If you could please\Ntake a seat, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku, let's go and pick out a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku? Taku!\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.\NI was checking in at reception,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and I realized\Nthat Taku had gotten away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Taku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My son. He's only four.\NDid you see him leaving the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ma'am, I've been posted\Nat the entrance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't say I've seen any kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he must be inside somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku! Taku, are you hiding anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, has your child gone missing?\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a toddler just a minute ago, ma'am.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he was heading\Ntoward the admin offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He went that way?{\i0}\N{\i1}Taku, can you hear me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ma'am, wait a moment, please!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll split up and search.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One step at a time, ma'am.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats a good trip\Nto the sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't be outside, would he?\NI haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So then he must be inside the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've searched the entire building\Nexcept for one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in there? He must be inside.\NThere's nowhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it. I need to get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our vault.\NWe can't open it without getting approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's both for the business\Nand the CEO's own valuables as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't open it\Nwithout his permission, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention it's difficult\Nto imagine he would have gotten in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's all right by you,\NI'm gonna take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staff. I work\Nin the maintenance department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective Utsumi, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm off duty, but I was walking by,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and I overheard shouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You say a child's gone missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we believe\Nhe's here somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but haven't managed to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Toshio's on our six.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, and the woman over there,\Nis she the child's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku, answer me,\Nwhere are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, I'm going to help you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When did this all start?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, we can't let him see your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the next phase of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear a kid crying in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen for yourself.\N Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy, help me! I'm scared!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:06:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to move fast. These types of safes\Nare designed to be airtight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's someone in there,\Nthe oxygen level is dwindling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NHow much oxygen is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say,\Nbut it's possible he's already at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really not going to open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective, as we've said,\Nwe need the CEO's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I haven't been able\Nto get through to him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, "I've stopped hearing his voice."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've stopped hearing his voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective, you've got to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you. Taku needs your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it,\Nyou're gonna do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The CEO wouldn't be happy with us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really a time to be\Nconcerned about how he's going to react?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The life of a child\Nis hanging in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for the assist, Toshio.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If something unthinkable\Nhappens to this child,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be the one who answers for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh...\NYou're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've got the code!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry!{\i0}\N{\i1}Sir, please hurry and open it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy!\NUh, wait, ma'am! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire broke out? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}WE HAVE CLAIMED THE THREE GOLD-PAINTED\NTENMOKU TEA BOWLS MADE BY JUNKEI TOBARI
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Cat's Eye just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe\NToshio turned up yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to him,\Nhe has a sixth sense for Cat's Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's clueless about everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have done it\Nwithout Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With that super brain of hers,\Nshe always come up with the perfect plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, there's no such thing\Nas a perfect plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Like yesterday, sometimes you get\Nthrown a curveball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important part of a heist\Nis being able to roll with the punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do anything\Nif you put your mind to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day,\Nyou've just gotta go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen, now that we've got\Nthe tea bowls, what's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they aren't what we were after\Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, and that's why we're\Ngoing to return them before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did we steal them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this. It turns out\Nthat Kaburagi Real Estate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,was auctioning off\Nsome of the president's artwork
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep the company afloat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,including those tea bowls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But think what would happen if they were\Nstolen before the auction took place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If the company is desperate for money,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,then they'd have no choice but to put\Nsomething else on the block instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:09:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, {\i1}A Girl from One Day{\i0}\Nwill be in the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it sells,\Nit'll be transported to the top bidder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We wait for that\Nrather than trying to get it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,out of\NAkitsushima Transportation's depository,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're much more likely to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we have your big brain, Rui,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing in the world\Nwe can't steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's really impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's impressive?\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Toshio! We aren't open yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you loosen up?\NIt's just me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't overhear us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,\Nwhat were you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seemed like something good.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, we were talking about what it takes\Nto make a good coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You were?\NYeah, you got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever Rui is on the old percolator,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know\Nit's gonna be a good cup of joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Ai, uh, I didn't think you drank\Nregular coffee, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I meant a latte!\NOoh, a latte?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that. She can even do\Nart with milk foam. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push it, Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She can do latte art?\NI would love to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, weary as my heart is, I would be\Nmuch soothed by such a beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One latte, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,First time for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put your mind to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And here you are. One cafe latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Oh, Rui,\Nyou can do anything, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}can{\i0} do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You put your mind to it.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh! I've got a meeting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Go get them, Toshio.\NYep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the inventory\Nof art pieces recently sold at an auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all bound to be shipped\Nacross the Pacific
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,to America by freighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Selling the pieces is the CEO\Nof Kaburagi Real Estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Given that Cat's Eye recently stole\Nsome of his ceramic pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,he's requested police involvement\Nfor security.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we haven't gotten any kind of\Nannouncement from them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we haven't,\Nwe can't let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't always tell us beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they just leave\Ntheir calling card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Just like the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,when you let them slip\Nright past you, Utsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you are! That was my bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you're the only detective\Nwho's even managed to come that close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.55,0:11:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to disappoint me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! I'll catch them\Nthis time for sure. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl...\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. For some reason,\Nshe seems familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that reminds me. There's something\NI can't stop thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The girl in the painting looks exactly{\i0}\N{\i1}like Hitomi did when she was a little kid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. It was before{\i0}\N{\i1}you were born, so you wouldn't know,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but the model for {\i1}A Girl from One Day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,was me.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That painting is one he did\Nespecially for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where we're going\Non our date today, the sweets buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! That looks awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've basically got a 360 degree view\Nof Tokyo Bay too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls, we've hit a bit of a snag.\N Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what's the snag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone bought {\i1}A Girl from One Day,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but the buyer is a museum in Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that it will be\Nshipping to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NThe auction was aimed at domestic buyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so I never considered\Nthat it would get sold overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then why not go after\Nthe boat and transit anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I thought of that and even have\Nthe ship's loading schematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But here is the vessel it's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and the only way to access\Nthe pier is by this bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So that is our only escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose that, then we're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that we can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's way too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, Toshio will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:12:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think what will happen\Nif you get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The piece will be part\Nof an exhibition the Seattle Museum sends
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to Japan every three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going get another shot at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi, I understand what you're feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but just hold out a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going to get it back someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're going to a sweets buffet\Nwith Toshio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Forget about the painting for now\Nand just go have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So many choices, I can't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to eat all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got room\Nin the old bread basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plate had better be clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, did you ever do any modeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,like maybe when you were a little kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Modeling? Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I saw this painting recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and the girl in it\Nlooked exactly like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm sorry. I'm not allowed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been another kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say that I remember modeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, though, it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a certain warmth\Nin how it was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The painter's affection for her\Npractically jumps off the canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Toshio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something\NI need to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Like right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll regret it if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that I'm going\Nto make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! These desserts\Nwon't know what hit 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew! All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai? I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this project of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.\NRui asked me to make it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So what is it for?\NDon't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.49,0:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, aren't you back\Nfrom your date early?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, there is something\Nthat I was hoping you could make for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am asking\Nthat you don't talk to Rui about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}AKITSUSHIMA TRANSPORTATION WAREHOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rui, I'm sorry. But three years,{\i0}\N{\i1}that's just too long to wait.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's everything. All secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. Let's hit the road.\NBe ready for anything out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}AKITSUSHIMA TRANSPORTATION CONTAINER PORT
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What the... What?\N
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a flash grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So bright! My eyes! Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done it again, Ai.\NThese really pack a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[officers and workers\Nyelling indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A GIRL FROM ONE DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cat's Eye for sure!\NWe're not letting her get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Block off the pier entrance!\NThat's the only escape route she's got!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,ROAD CLOSED
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Cat's Eye!\NThis all ends today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the kitty\Npicked the wrong way to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the water below,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,chances are, you wouldn't walk away\Nfrom a fall this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you've met your match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice and slow, drop the painting\Nand come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't, then I'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No! Anyone but Toshio!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rui, Ai, I'm sorry.{\i0}\N{\i1}I should have listened to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Damn it! She had backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cats are making their escape by boat!\NMove out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been pretty bad\Nif we hadn't shown up, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Ai, how did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the time.\NLet's make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the cherry on top...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me proud, Rui.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know,\Nbut it's about to be full of bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You can't just start shooting\Nwhen we're all piled in like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:20:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My deadly kung fu kick\Ncan take it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"WE HAVE CLAIMED\NA GIRL FROM ONE DAY"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What was that, moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.99,0:20:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- I'm not a moron!\N That was epic, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're scot-free.\NThe police won't be coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With that tech, Toshio and the other cops\Nwon't get out of there too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you both for being there.\NYou really saved my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you know we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, how did you manage to find me\Nat the exact right moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me. Our sister\Nwas the one who put this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you not to talk\Nto her about it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't say anything.\NYou didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, by the time you asked me\Nto make some gear for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,she had already asked me\Nto help with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you saying\Nthat Rui has known the entire time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that I was going to steal this painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known you\Nfor a good long while, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your face and knew\Nthat you wouldn't give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said the heist would be too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But sometimes, it's worth risking it,\N'cause even when it's dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it can pay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As we say...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put your mind to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.59,0:21:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So the saying goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Always one step ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you, Rui?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Hitomi, you're risking life and limbs\Nto secure this painting is hard to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagaishi, I'm sorry\Nto make you worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't wanna lose this painting.\NI was willing to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It represents a special memory with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly glad that you're all right.\NPlease, come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get\Nall of them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last one of Dad's paintings\Nand everything from his collection too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in these beautiful pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we're bound to get a clue\Nthat will help us find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The more well-known\NCat's Eye becomes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the more likely it is\Nthat Dad will come looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, we'll find you. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:41.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}The city is a sparkling passion fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:44.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}That winks every night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:47.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Passion beat inside the glass
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:51.56,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}I'll fall in love after one sip
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:59.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}lf the wind catches a sweet melody tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:07.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}A secret door will open somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Cat's Eye gazing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.91,0:23:13.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Shimmering green
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.25,0:23:15.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Mysterious Cat's Eye
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:20.00,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Basking in moonlight